  "description": "PandaTech.Communicator is a .NET 9 library for sending Email (SMTP via MailKit) and SMS through a simple, DI-friendly API.\n            It supports multiple channels per application and includes built-in SMS providers (Dexatel, Twilio) with configuration via\n            appsettings.json or programmatic setup for reliable messaging across different use cases.",
