  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0\n            - Refined SMTP behavior for modern submission ports (587 STARTTLS / 465 implicit TLS).\n            - Improved internal validation and error messages for analyzers.\n            - Refactored internal email/sms sending code for safer concurrency and cleaner structure (no public contract changes).\n            - Documentation overhaul and updated examples.",
